 7189+7D02              ;57) align speed on UART and module, speed taken from IX+2. If IX+2=255, align at max MBFW speed. Or speed taken from A,
 7190+7D02              ; then call set_user_defined_speed_a
 7191+7D02              ;mostly for usage in SM2.0
 7192+7D02              ;INPUT=D=currently aligned speed. If D=255 continue with speed align, if 0-23 compare with
 7193+7D02              ;speed you want to align, if same, do not continue.
